Package: desktop-clock
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Brendan <myredroom@gmail.com>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-pango-1.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1 | gir1.2-webkit2-4.0
Description: Analog/digital desktop clock
 A Python GTK3 desktop clock with analog and digital display modes,
 alarms, timers, snap-to-corner, and per-monitor position memory.
 Runs as a lightweight always-on-top overlay with a system tray icon.
 HomieLab Tracker integration requires a local HomieLab Tracker instance.
